{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_60","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc \"cat > /private/tmp/write_5a_report.py <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\nimport re,subprocess\nbase=Path('collab')\nprefix='1791850000000-5a-'\nns=['yin.vm.semantic-register.'+x+'-test' for x in ['derive','code','linearize','analysis','load-paths','vm','walker-trace','parity','effects','link']]+['yin.vm.debruijn-test','yin.vm.debruijn-code-test','yin.vm.debruijn-resolve-test','yin.vm.debruijn-linearize-test','yin.vm.debruijn-register-contract-test','yin.vm.debruijn.stack-test','yin.vm.debruijn.stack-effects-test','yin.vm.debruijn.stack-parity-test','yin.vm.debruijn-vm-contract-test','yin.vm-test','yin.vm.parity-test']\ndartns=ns[:18]+[ns[-1]]\nregex=r'\"'^yin'\"\\\\\\\\.vm\\\\\\\\.(semantic-register\\\\\\\\.(derive|code|linearize|analysis|load-paths|vm|walker-trace|parity|effects|link)-test|debruijn(-code|-resolve|-linearize|-register-contract)?-test|debruijn\\\\\\\\.(stack|stack-effects|stack-parity)-test|parity-test)\"'$'\"'\ngmt=subprocess.check_output(['date','-u','+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S GMT'],text=True).strip()\nlocal=subprocess.check_output(['env','TZ=Asia/Bangkok','date','+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S Asia/Bangkok'],text=True).strip()\ns=f'''Completed-GMT: {gmt}\nCompleted-Local: {local}\n\nImplementation report for slice 5a, VM Engineer (yin.vm). Worktree \"'`/Users/sto/workspace/datomworld-srvm-p5a`, branch `srvm-phase5a`. Implementation only: no independent review or sign-off performed. No files staged or committed.\n\nChanged files (new versus modified)\n\n- NEW: `src/cljc/yin/vm/semantic_register/derive.cljc`: lexical resolution from A'\"'s closure-owner chain; pc-ordered address readers; stackification of A's parsed expressions; FIFO closure bodies; absolute labels; diagnostic side table; \"'`register-image` throws exactly `{{:reason :not-in-slice-5a}}`.\n- NEW: `test/yin/vm/semantic_register/derive_test.cljc`: 94 structural corpus rows (26 B0 + 32 register + 15 respelled